{"displayStem":"반복 수막구균 감염 병력이 있는 환자의 신선 혈청을 규정 조건으로 처리하였다. 다른 날 새로 채취한 검체에서도 같은 양상이었다. 각각 정제 성분 하나를 더해 CH50과 AH50을 독립적으로 3회 측정하였다. 정상 대조 혈청은 전 과정에서 기능을 유지하였다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>기능 검사 반복값</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"기능 검사 반복값。첨가 조건、대조 대비 기능 (%)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">대조 대비 기능 (%)</text><line x1=\"122.31578947368422\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"122.31578947368422\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"122.31578947368422\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">없음</text><line x1=\"238.10526315789474\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"238.10526315789474\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"238.10526315789474\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C5</text><line x1=\"353.89473684210526\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"353.89473684210526\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"353.89473684210526\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C3</text><line x1=\"469.6842105263158\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"469.6842105263158\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"469.6842105263158\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C6</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">60</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">90</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">120</text><circle cx=\"115.36842105263159\" cy=\"226.1\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"115.36842105263159\" cy=\"223.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"115.36842105263159\" cy=\"224.65\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"231.1578947368421\" cy=\"97.05000000000001\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"231.1578947368421\" cy=\"89.79999999999998\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"231.1578947368421\" cy=\"92.69999999999999\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"346.94736842105266\" cy=\"224.65\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"346.94736842105266\" cy=\"221.75\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"346.94736842105266\" cy=\"223.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"462.7368421052631\" cy=\"226.1\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"462.7368421052631\" cy=\"223.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"462.7368421052631\" cy=\"224.65\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">CH50</text><rect x=\"126.06315789473685\" y=\"221.45000000000002\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"126.06315789473685\" y=\"222.9\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"126.06315789473685\" y=\"220\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"241.85263157894738\" y=\"98.2\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"241.85263157894738\" y=\"89.49999999999999\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=